# These are paper-example source files, not knitr outputs. Re-include them:
# the parent vignettes/.gitignore ignores *.R/*.md to keep generated vignette
# artefacts out of the repo, but here those extensions are hand-written sources.
!*.R
!*.md

# ...but never track generated figure outputs (also covered by the repo-root
# *.png/*.pdf rules; kept explicit so the whole folder is clearly ignored).
figures/
